<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 5px; }
        .header { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #f0ad4e; }
        .meta { color: #666; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px; }
        .content { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #444; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .footer { font-size: 11px; color: #999; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 10px; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">[ACTION REQUIRED] EDC Clinical Query Raised</div>
        <div class="meta">
            <strong>Study ID:</strong> {{ study_id }}<br>
            <strong>Event ID:</strong> {{ event_id }}<br>
            <strong>Timestamp (UTC):</strong> {{ timestamp_utc }}
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear Site Coordinator,</p>
            <p>A new clinical data discrepancy query has been raised for your site:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Site ID:</strong> {{ payload.site_id }}</li>
                <li><strong>Subject ID:</strong> {{ payload.subject_id }}</li>
                <li><strong>Form Name:</strong> {{ payload.form_name }}</li>
                <li><strong>Field Name:</strong> {{ payload.field_name }}</li>
                <li><strong>Query Message:</strong> {{ payload.query_message }}</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Please log in to the EDC system to review the query and submit a correction or response with the appropriate GxP change justification.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated system-generated notification from Cadence Clinical EDC.<br>
            All electronic query responses comply with FDA 21 CFR Part 11 requirements.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
